# ...except the committed template of it.
!.env.example

# Source investor spreadsheets.
#
# This repository is PUBLIC, and the workbooks hold real names, email addresses
# and phone numbers for roughly 1,150 people. Committing one would publish that
# to anyone who clones the repo, permanently and irrevocably -- git history
# keeps a blob even after the file is deleted in a later commit.
#
# These files are an import *source*, not app data. `scripts/import-investors.mjs`
# loads them into Supabase, and the database is the system of record. Keep the
# workbook local (or in shared drive storage with access control) and never here.
*.xlsx
*.xls
